{'symbol': 'EPAM', 'date': '2023-03-22 03:02:00', 'title': 'EPAM RECOGNIZED AS A TOP IT SOURCING VENDOR IN THE NETHERLANDS', 'text': 'RECOGNITION BASED ON EXCEPTIONAL CUSTOMER SATISFACTION EVALUATION, RATING EPAM AS THE OVERALL TOP IT SOURCING VENDOR IN THE NETHERLANDS BY WHITELANE RESEARCH NEWTOWN, PA. , MARCH 22, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EPAM SYSTEMS, INC. (NYSE: EPAM), A LEADING DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION SERVICES AND PRODUCT ENGINEERING COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS BEEN NAMED A TOP IT SOURCING VENDOR IN THE NETHERLANDS ACROSS MULTIPLE SECTORS AND INDUSTRY VERTICALS BY WHITELANE RESEARCH, AN INDEPENDENT ORGANIZATION FOCUSED ON IT SOURCING RESEARCH ACROSS EUROPE.'}